# (SEO Critical). /sitemap.xml is generated dynamically by the
# backend (see backend/src/modules/sitemap), but robots.txt's Sitemap:
# directive needs it served from this same frontend domain to be
# reliably respected — a cross-host Sitemap: entry generally isn't. This
# proxies the request through to the backend so it appears same-origin
# to crawlers while the content stays live/dynamic. A rewrite (200), not
# a redirect (301/302): the browser/crawler keeps seeing this domain's
# own /sitemap.xml URL, never sees the backend's URL.
#
# REQUIRED MANUAL STEP: replace the placeholder domain below with your
# actual deployed backend API URL (same value as VITE_API_URL /
# connect-src in _headers) before deploying. This
# line must come before the catch-all rewrite below, since Netlify uses
# the first matching rule.
/sitemap.xml   https://api.nexoramarketplace.online/sitemap.xml   200

